{"s":1,"v":[{"t":"In the name of Allāh, the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful.","w":[["بِسْمِ","In (the) name","bis'mi","",[["بِ",10],["سْمِ",312]]],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","the Most Gracious","l-raḥmāni","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحْمَـٰنِ",216]]],["ٱلرَّحِيمِ","the Most Merciful","l-raḥīmi","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحِيمِ",119]]]]},{"t":"[All] praise is [due] to Allāh, Lord of the worlds -","w":[["ٱلْحَمْدُ","All praises and thanks","al-ḥamdu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَمْدُ",282]]],["لِلَّهِ","(be) to Allah","lillahi","",[["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["رَبِّ","the Lord","rabbi",""],["ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","of the universe","l-ʿālamīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَـٰلَمِينَ",174]]]]},{"t":"The Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful,","w":[["ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","The Most Gracious","al-raḥmāni","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحْمَـٰنِ",216]]],["ٱلرَّحِيمِ","the Most Merciful","l-raḥīmi","",[["ٱل",2],["رَّحِيمِ",119]]]]},{"t":"Sovereign of the Day of Recompense.","w":[["مَـٰلِكِ","(The) Master","māliki",""],["يَوْمِ","(of the) Day","yawmi",""],["ٱلدِّينِ","(of the) Judgment","l-dīni","",[["ٱل",2],["دِّينِ",136]]]]},{"t":"It is You we worship and You we ask for help.","w":[["إِيَّاكَ","You Alone","iyyāka",""],["نَعْبُدُ","we worship","naʿbudu",""],["وَإِيَّاكَ","and You Alone","wa-iyyāka","",[["وَ",1],["إِيَّاكَ",441]]],["نَسْتَعِينُ","we ask for help","nastaʿīnu",""]]},{"t":"Guide us to the straight path -","w":[["ٱهْدِنَا","Guide us","ih'dinā","",[["ٱهْدِ",96],["نَا",11]]],["ٱلصِّرَٰطَ","(to) the path","l-ṣirāṭa","",[["ٱل",2],["صِّرَٰطَ",269]]],["ٱلْمُسْتَقِيمَ","the straight","l-mus'taqīma","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُسْتَقِيمَ",331]]]]},{"t":"The path of those upon whom You have bestowed favor, not of those who have earned [Your] anger or of those who are astray.","w":[["صِرَٰطَ","(The) path","ṣirāṭa",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(of) those","alladhīna",""],["أَنْعَمْتَ","You have bestowed (Your) Favors","anʿamta","",[["أَنْعَمْ",559],["تَ",18]]],["عَلَيْهِمْ","on them","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["غَيْرِ","not (of)","ghayri",""],["ٱلْمَغْضُوبِ","those who earned (Your) wrath","l-maghḍūbi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَغْضُوبِ",4209]]],["عَلَيْهِمْ","on themselves","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","(of) those who go astray","l-ḍālīna","",[["ٱل",2],["ضَّآلِّينَ",653]]]]}]}